                  "key": "doc_type",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "(Required) Can only be Serial or Parallel. \n 1. Serial: the signing or reviewing process will be based on the order of recipients. \n 2. Parallel: signer or reviewer can sign the document without having to wait for a previous one."
